# Team Cereus — sibling projects & related tools

## Identity

**Team Cereus** is the canonical name for this project's modding group. Use **"Team Cereus"** or **"Cereus"** in docs, agent replies, commit scopes, and package naming — not ad-hoc labels unless the user specifies otherwise.

Related GitHub org: [team-cereus](https://github.com/team-cereus) (e.g. [soulstruct-blender](https://github.com/team-cereus/soulstruct-blender)).

## Sibling projects

| Path | What it is | When to use |
|------|------------|-------------|
| `S:\_modding\tools\soulstruct-blender` | **THIS repo:** Blender add-on (`io_soulstruct` + `io_soulstruct_lib`), Stan's Tools character/weapon/animation preview | Blender import/export, assembly preview, animation workflow |
| `S:\souls-script-kt` | **souls-param** Kotlin toolkit: `.nr.kts` / `.er.kts` param patch scripts, mod-merge, mod-installer, HKS DSL. Param schemas in `configs/paramdex/` | Mod scripting home; param patches, ME3 packages, regulation work |
| `S:\the-heolstor-files` | **Eclipse:** collaborative Nightreign mod design project (design docs distilled from brainstorms by Heolstor, friend/designer). Single home for Eclipse mod design; will hold `.nr.kts` scripts under `scripts/` | When Blender work supports Eclipse content (models, animations). Key files: `README.md`, `low-hanging-fruit.md`, `VERSIONING.md` (SemVer + codenames like 0.1.0 "Tallowflame"), `characters/`, `bosses/`, `weapons/`, `dormant-powers/` |
| `S:\fromsoftware-rs` | Rust game introspection + `cereus_debug.dll` placement overlay (F1 toggle, F5 mark position) | In-game placement debug, Havok/introspection examples |
| `S:\_modding\tools\DSAnimStudio` | **DSAS source:** parity reference for character assembly, skeleton mapping, dummy transforms, weapon attach | When Blender behavior differs from in-game — check DSAS first (`NewChrAsm`, `NewSkeletonMapper`, `NewDummyPolyManager`, `WepAbsorpPosParam` handling) |

